{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PRF","kind":"identifier"}],"extendedModule":"YubiKit","modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PRF","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7YubiKit8WebAuthnO9ExtensionO3PRFV","title":"WebAuthn.Extension.PRF","symbolKind":"struct"},"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/#prf-extension"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for deriving symmetric keys.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PRF","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This WebAuthn extension wraps the CTAP2 hmac-secret extension, transforming"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PRF secrets into hmac-secret salts using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SHA-256(\"WebAuthn PRF\\0\" + secret)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Simple-Usage-single-credential","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Simple Usage (single credential)"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let prf = try await WebAuthn.Extension.PRF(session: session)","let ext = try prf.getAssertion.input(first: userSecret)","let params = CTAP2.GetAssertion.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.getAssertion(parameters: params)","if let secrets = try prf.getAssertion.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ Use derived keys","}"]},{"anchor":"Multi-credential-Usage-evalByCredential","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Multi-credential Usage (evalByCredential)"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let prf = try await WebAuthn.Extension.PRF(","    first: defaultSecret,","    evalByCredential: [credIdA: (secretA, nil), credIdB: (secretB, nil)],","    session: session",")","","\/\/ After credential selection:","let ext = try prf.getAssertion.input(for: selectedCredentialId)","let params = CTAP2.GetAssertion.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.getAssertion(parameters: params)","if let secrets = try prf.getAssertion.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ Use derived keys","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pseudo-random function extension for deriving symmetric secrets bound to a credential."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PRF"},{"type":"text","text":" lets a relying party derive deterministic symmetric secrets from a credential"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"— the same input produces the same output every time the user authenticates with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that credential. It’s the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/#prf-extension","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for credential-bound key derivation, built on the CTAP2 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hmac-secret"},{"type":"text","text":" extension."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The SDK transforms each PRF input with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SHA-256(\"WebAuthn PRF\\0\" || input)"},{"type":"text","text":" before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sending it to the authenticator — that domain separation is mandated by the spec."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In a high-level WebAuthn flow, configure "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PRF"},{"type":"text","text":" per ceremony via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/RegistrationInputs\/prf","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/AuthenticationInputs\/prf","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; outputs come back on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientExtensionResults"},{"type":"text","text":" of the corresponding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Response"},{"type":"text","text":". Registration enables"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PRF on a credential, optionally deriving secrets at the same time on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authenticators that support hmac-secret-mc. Authentication evaluates the PRF at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one or more inputs and returns the derived bytes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Registration: enable PRF on the new credential","let regOpts = WebAuthn.Registration.Options(","    challenge: challenge,","    rp: .init(id: \"example.com\", name: \"Example\"),","    user: .init(id: userId, name: \"alice@example.com\"),","    extensions: .init(prf: .enable)",")","let registration = try await client.makeCredential(regOpts, authorization: auth).value","","\/\/ Authentication: derive a secret bound to the credential","let authOpts = WebAuthn.Authentication.Options(","    challenge: challenge,","    rpId: \"example.com\",","    allowCredentials: [.init(id: storedCredentialId)],","    extensions: .init(prf: .eval(first: encryptionSeed))",")","let assertions = try await client.getAssertion(authOpts, authorization: auth).value","let derived = assertions.fir